%% title: Gmail alert synchronization job sequence
%% last_updated: 2026-07-28
sequenceDiagram
    participant Trigger as User / Vercel cron
    participant API as Gmail sync route
    participant Queue as BackgroundJob
    participant Worker as Gmail sync worker
    participant Gmail as Gmail API
    participant DB as Azure SQL

    Trigger->>API: Request sync
    API->>Queue: Enqueue scoped GMAIL_SYNC job
    Queue-->>API: Created or deduplicated job
    API->>Worker: Process bounded slice
    Worker->>Queue: Claim lease
    Worker->>Gmail: Read history or bounded query page
    Gmail-->>Worker: Message IDs and cursor
    loop Relevant messages
        Worker->>Gmail: Fetch message metadata/body
        Worker->>DB: Parse, deduplicate, stage card alert
    end
    alt More pages
        Worker->>Queue: Save checkpoint and continue later
    else Complete
        Worker->>DB: Persist Gmail history cursor
        Worker->>Queue: Mark completed
    end
